# {{alternative form of|bg|с}}

====Usage notes====
In writing, '''със''' is used in front of words starting with ''с'' or ''з'' and '''с''' is used elsewhere. In speech, '''с''' and '''със''' are used interchangeably. In writing and in speech, '''със''' is also used as an emphatic form of '''с''', even before words not beginning with ''с'' or ''з'':
:{{ux|bg|'''със''' или [[без]] твоя помощ|'''with''' or without your help}}
In verse, '''със''' can also be used in front of words not starting with ''с'' or ''з'' in order to maintain the syllable structure of the line.